<h2>Sudden vs. Gradual: The Central Issue</h2>
<p>Most homeowners policies cover sudden and accidental water discharge and exclude long-term seepage, wear, and deterioration. The line between them is where most water claims are decided.</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Situation</th><th>How insurers often view it</th><th>Helpful evidence</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
