<tr><td>Water heater tank ruptures</td><td>Resulting water damage often covered; tank usually not</td><td>Photos, age of unit, plumber’s report</td></tr>
<tr><td>Slow drip behind a shower wall</td><td>May be treated as continuous seepage</td><td>Plumber’s findings on when and how the leak started</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hidden slab leak discovered by a high water bill</td><td>Depends on policy wording for hidden leaks</td><td>Leak detection report, water bills by month</td></tr>
